# Stack

- React
- TypeScript
- Vite
- SCSS modules
- React Router
- Framer Motion

# Rules

- Use functional components only
- Use named exports
- Avoid default exports except pages
- Avoid prop drilling deeper than 2 levels
- Prefer local state over global state
- Do not introduce Redux unless requested
- Keep components under 200 lines
- Extract reusable logic into hooks
- Prefer composition over inheritance

# Styling

- Use SCSS modules
- One component = one scss module
- Use kebab-case for class names
- Avoid inline styles

# File structure

/components
/pages
/hooks
/services
/types
/utils

# API

- Use async/await only
- Always handle loading and error states
- Never ignore rejected promises

# Forms

- Controlled inputs only

# Typescript

- Avoid any
- Prefer explicit types for props
- Use discriminated unions where appropriate